nt status · "],"Choose “Show current status” for a text snapshot."],["FIELDSET",{"aria-label":"1. Choose scenario","class":"nk-rx-control-group mt-3 rounded-xl border p-2.5","style":"border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.4); background: rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.1);"},["LEGEND",{"class":"px-1.5 text-[0.6875rem] font-black","style":"color: rgb(52, 211, 153);"},"1 · Choose scenario"],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap gap-1"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-pressed":"true","aria-label":"Hold at full power. Run the scenario: Hold at full power. Keep power between 95% and 105% for 60 seconds.","data-nk-explored":"false","class":"min-h-11 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-[0.6875rem] font-bold transition-colors","style":"background: rgb(52, 211, 153); color: rgb(11, 16, 32); border: 1px solid rgb(52, 211, 153);"},"Hold at full power"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-pressed":"false","aria-label":"The xenon pit. Run the scenario: The xenon pit. Drop to 20% power, hold 90 seconds, then get back above 80%.","data-nk-explored":"false","class":"min-h-11 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-[0.6875rem] font-bold transition-colors","style":"background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12); color: rgb(226, 232, 240); border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);"},"The xenon pit"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-pressed":"false","aria-label":"Station blackout. Run the scenario: Station blackout. After the scram, keep fuel below 1200 °C for 120 seconds.","data-nk-explored":"false","class":"min-h-11 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-[0.6875rem] font-bold transition-colors","style":"background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12); color: rgb(226, 232, 240); border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);"},"Station blackout"]],["P",{"class":"text-[0.6875rem] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed","style":"color: rgb(226, 232, 240);"},["B",{},"Keep power between 95% and 105% for 60 seconds. "],"The ordinary job. Rods trim the reaction against slow drifts. Notice how sluggish the response feels — that lag is the delayed neutrons, and without them this would be uncontrollable."],["DIV",{"id":"rx-objective-progress","role":"group","aria-labelledby":"rx-objective-heading","data-stage":"steady-hold","data-tone":"neutral","class":"nk-rx-objective mt-2 rounded-lg border p-2.5","style":"border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.48); background: rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.2);"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"},["P",{"id":"rx-objective-heading","class":"text-[0.625rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wide","style":"color: rgb(110, 231, 183);"},"Objective progress"],["SPAN",{"id":"rx-objective-tone","class":"nk-rx-tone inline-flex rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.625rem] font-black"},"Ready to begin"]],["P",{"id":"rx-objective-step","class":"mt-1 text-[0.6875rem] font-black","style":"color: rgb(209, 250, 229);"},"Hold inside the 95–105% power band"],["PROGRESS",{"id":"rx-objective-meter","value":"0","max":"60","aria-labelledby":"rx-objective-step","aria-describedby":"rx-objective-detail","aria-valuetext":"0 of 60 continuous seconds in range.","class":"mt-2 w-full h-3","style":"accent-color: rgb(5, 150, 105);"}],["OUTPUT",{"id":"rx-objective-detail","class":"block mt-1 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed","style":"color: rgb(209, 250, 229);"},"0 of 60 continuous seconds in range."]]],["FIELDSET",{"aria-label":"2. Choose core design","class":"nk-rx-control-group mt-2 rounded-xl border p-2.5","style":"border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4); background: rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.1);"},["LEGEND",{"class":"px-1.5 text-[0.6875rem] font-black","style":"color: rgb(96, 165, 250);"},"2 · Choose core design"],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap gap-1"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-pressed":"true","aria-label":"Modern PWR. Switch the core to Modern PWR","data-nk-explored":"false","class":"min-h-11 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-[0.6875rem] font-bold transition-colors","style":"background: rgb(96, 165, 250); color: rgb(11, 16, 32); border: 1px solid rgb(96, 165, 250);"},"Modern PWR"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-pressed":"false","aria-labe