-137 at 37 gigabecquerels. Unshielded it is 2.841 millisieverts per hour at 1 metre and 0.114 at 5 metres. At your chosen 1 metres behind 0 centimetres of air it is 2.841 millisieverts per hour.","style":"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;","width":"560","height":"218"}]],[[4,1305]],[[4,1307]],[[4,1314]],[[4,1323]],[[4,1345]],[[4,1347]],[[4,1349]]],[[4,1398]],["DIV",{"class":"nk-section-card rounded-xl border p-3 mt-4","id":"nksec-shelter","data-nk-sec":"shelter","aria-labelledby":"nkheading-shelter","tabindex":"-1","style":"border-color: rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.333) rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.333) rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.333) rgb(163, 230, 53); border-left-width: 4px; border-left-style: solid; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78); background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.094) 0%, transparent 38%); box-shadow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 0px 1px 0px inset, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) 0px 16px 34px -26px; scroll-margin-top: 96px;"},[[4,1400]],[[4,1407]],[[4,1409]],[[4,1411]],[[4,1417]],[[4,1423]],[[4,1429]],[[4,1431]],[[4,1442]],[[4,1444]],[[4,1446]],["DIV",{"class":"nk-chart-frame rounded-lg overflow-hidden border mb-2","style":"border-color: rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.35); height: 180px;"},["CANVAS",{"__playwright_bounding_rect__":"{\"left\":55,\"top\":12574.28125,\"right\":1048,\"bottom\":12752.28125}","role":"img","data-a11y-static":"true","aria-describedby":"nk-shelter-summary","aria-label":"Dose against how long it takes to get clear. Sheltering in a brick or concrete house through a 8 hour release gives a flat 3.2 millisieverts. Evacuating gives 7.2 millisieverts after 4 hours in the open. The two are equal at 1.8 hours: get clear faster than that and leaving costs less dose, slower and it costs more.","style":"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;","width":"560","height":"218"}]],[[4,1459]],[[4,1466]],[[4,1479]],[[4,1481]],[[4,1497]],[[4,1504]],[[4,1506]]],[[4,1605]],[[4,1661]],[[4,1708]],["DIV",{"class":"nk-section-card rounded-xl border p-3 mt-4