scription","aria-label":"Decay curve. After 0 half-lives, 100 percent of the Carbon-14 remains. The curve halves at every step and never quite reaches zero.","width":"560","height":"218","style":"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;"}]],[[4,96]],[[4,112]],[[4,116]],[[4,121]]],[[4,140]],["DIV",{"class":"nk-section-card rounded-xl border p-3 mt-4","id":"nksec-chain","data-nk-sec":"chain","aria-labelledby":"nkheading-chain","tabindex":"-1","style":"border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.333) rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.333) rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.333) rgb(192, 132, 252); border-left-width: 4px; border-left-style: solid; background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78); background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.094) 0%, transparent 38%); box-shadow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 0px 1px 0px inset, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) 0px 16px 34px -26px; scroll-margin-top: 96px;"},[[4,142]],[[4,144]],["DIV",{"class":"rounded-lg overflow-hidden border mb-2","style":"border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.35); height: 230px;"},["CANVAS",{"__playwright_bounding_rect__":"{\"left\":55,\"top\":1264.5,\"right\":1048,\"bottom\":1492.5}","role":"img","data-a11y-static":"true","aria-describedby":"nk-chain-description","aria-label":"The uranium-238 chain plotted on the chart of nuclides, neutrons across and protons up. It starts at uranium-238 with 92 protons and 146 neutrons, top right, and walks down-left to lead-206 with 82 protons and 124 neutrons, bottom left. Each of the eight alpha steps moves two protons down and two neutrons left; each of the six beta steps moves one proton up and one neutron left, which is the zigzag. Radon-222, the only gas, sits in the middle at 86 protons and 136 neutrons.","width":"560","height":"228","style":"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;"}]],[[4,148]],[[4,318]],[[4,324]],[[4,329]],[[4,334]]],[[4,408]],[[4,468]],[[4,519]],["DIV",{"class":"nk-section-card rounded-xl border p-3 mt-4","id":"nksec-binding","data-nk-sec":"binding","aria-labelledby":"nkhe